@startuml
title Beam: etch

participant Anyone #EEEEEE
participant Server #EEEEEE
participant Beam #E6E0FA
participant "ION token" as ION #E6E0FA
participant "Card token" as Card #E6E0FA

note over Server: signs the attestation
Server -> Anyone: attestation
note over Anyone: gated tier: proof of the Engram
Anyone -> Beam: etch(payer, attestation, proof)
note over Beam: verify signature, expiry
note over Beam: verify the proof (gated tier)
note over Beam: card in stock
Beam -> ION: burn(payer, price)
Beam -> Card: transfer(receiver, 1)
@enduml
